stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Draft: create or import
  Draft --> Draft: edit, validate, simulate
  Draft --> Pending: request publish
  Pending --> Draft: reject
  Pending --> Published: approve by a different identity
  Published --> Retired: newer version becomes effective
  Retired --> Draft: restore as draft
  Published --> [*]
  Retired --> [*]
